    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Requirements</strong> You are an inventor with the Leyline Cartographer innovation or have surveyed the local landscape.<br /><hr />You scan the ambient magical topography and read the subtle ebb and flow of leylines across the battlefield. You and all allies within a 30-foot emanation gain a +10-foot status bonus to Speed for 1 round as the landscape shifts favorably underfoot.</p>"
